Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Spanify dbus::MessageReader::PopArrayOf..."

This reverts commit db0c78f6c5e352f608dd572fc325f6ae6a6de11b.
---
 dbus/message.cc          | 71 ++++++++++++++++------------------------
